    <projectUrl>https://github.com/marcschier/raft-cs</projectUrl>
    <description>Scalability-Protocols (BUS/PAIR) Raft transport built on NanoMsgSharp (managed nanomsg/NNG over tcp, tls, ipc, ws, and inproc).</description>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) marcschier</copyright>
    <tags>raft consensus transport nanomsg nng scalability-protocols</tags>
